/**
\fn pdg::Sprite::setAnimationDebugDraw(int flags)
\brief Select pose debug overlays.

Flags are combined with bitwise OR. Disabling overlays with zero is safe without a pose or GUI. Nonzero flags require both. Disabling/replacing the pose clears the flags.

\param flags pdg.animationDebug_None (0), Bones (1), Sockets (2), Boxes (4), or All (7), using the animationDebug_ prefix for each constant.

\return No value.

\par Example
\code{.js}
sprite.setAnimationDebugDraw(pdg.animationDebug_Bones | pdg.animationDebug_Sockets);
\endcode

\see getAnimationDebugDraw(), isAnimationDrawingSupported()
*/
